# =============================================================================
# TanahKita — .dockerignore (Tag: sec-0.2 / v0.2)
# Prevents secrets, git history, local caches, and host node_modules from
# leaking into Docker build context or image layers.
# =============================================================================
.git
.gitignore
.github
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
.secrets
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
security/lynis-*.txt
security/image-scan-*.txt
docs
*.md
